### Login to get Bearer token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "admin",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

> {%
client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Create Cliente (use este CPF para criar a OS)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "nome": "Mario Silva",
  "cpfCnpj": "17861341011",
  "email": "mario.silva@email.com",
  "telefone": "11987651234"
}

### Get Cliente by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Update Cliente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "nome": "João da Silva",
  "email": "joao.atualizado@email.com",
  "telefone": "11987654322"
}

### Delete Cliente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/clientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

